null,"0ahUKEwjWm5fm69GWAxV2VPUHHek0I74Q1bMECLMBKCM",null,null,null,[[2]]],[["/m/03by0vs"],"髮圈",null,[null,null,null,null,12,0,15],null,"0ahUKEwjWm5fm69GWAxV2VPUHHek0I74Q1bMECLQBKCQ",null,null,null,[[2]]],[["/m/01195fxr"],"半球",null,[null,null,null,null,6,0,6],null,"0ahUKEwjWm5fm69GWAxV2VPUHHek0I74Q1bMECLUBKCU",null,null,null,[[2]]]]],[["Hiro's らぁ麵kitchen 新店店是一間融合日本福岡傳統與台灣在地情感的高評價日式餐廳。選址於新店交通樞紐，緊鄰北新路三段與文化路，交通便利性極高，方便從大坪林捷運站或七張捷運站前來的食客尋找好吃的日本料理。周邊地標包含裕隆城與家樂福，是假日家庭聚餐與平日技嘉科技同仁下班後，找尋值得推薦的日式午晚餐絕佳去處。\n\n對於食材的龜毛態度成就了每一碗高品質的拉麵與咖哩飯，讓每一位來訪的顧客都能感受到食在安心的承諾。\n\n店內招牌豚骨拉麵與魚介豚骨拉麵，搭配嚴選的好吃雞排咖哩飯，是每日午晚餐的推薦熱銷項目。\n\n為了讓新店的夜晚更加精彩，晚餐限定時段推出市面罕見的卡布奇諾拉麵、極具層次感的喜必辛拉麵，以及飽足感十足的厚實豬排咖哩飯。透過台日友好合作，確保每一份餐點都符合日本料理精益求精的精神。\n\n來到新店北新路三段和文化路口，由最講究的豚骨湯頭與日式咖哩，呈現一場精采的味覺交響曲。"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,null,"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-8pdvye7IU2w/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/sO8ReJ6GfMM/s44-p-k-no-ns-nd/photo.jpg",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[1],"新北市新店區寶安里",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[null,1],0,[26,10,52,240,874],["評分和評論","分享你的經驗供他人參考",1,"詳細說明你在這個地點的親身體驗"],null,null,null,null,[[[[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTFpWQTJaako1WDNKeVp6SlNWRmhrWkZoYVZVRRAB",["0x0:0x7d434d74a298a4c9",null,1775893098898315,1775893098898315,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106543747816865173497/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Shirly Li","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvFBcobAuiBrbLJ00G8n6xJoTsn84wpaIo8siRbSbzJFQPijA\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106543747816865173497?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"106543747816865173497",null,225,1987,null,[1,8,1],4,["在地嚮導 · 225 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjWm5fm69GWAxV2VPUHHek0I74Qpr8GCC8oAA"]]]],null,"4 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[4],null,[["CIABIhAFy7vEKqIRWg7VguubtX19",["CI