AxV2VPUHHek0I74Q3YcHCEwoAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjWm5fm69GWAxV2VPUHHek0I74Q3IcHCEsoEA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["平日七點到訪也蠻多人排隊的，但是翻桌速度很快速。大概等候15分鐘就有位子了～\n候位排隊方式不用劃位，在門口旁邊有畫出來，建議可以先看一下再排隊～\n\n餐點部分推卡布奇諾拉麵$300 跟炸豬排！！\n\n卡布奇諾拉麵上面有綿密的泡沫，吃起來爽口帶有淡淡奶香及蒜香，基底應該是豚骨的，還有附一小盤起司，吃到一半加進拉麵裡會更濃郁😋\n\n炸豬排在咖喱飯裡面有六塊，厚厚的吃起來很滿足而且不柴！很推薦點著當小菜一起吃\n麵皮是薄的很酥脆的那種～\n\n咖喱的部分吃起來比較甜口，吃的出一些蕃茄及洋蔥的甜\u0026酸味，尾巴會有很細微辣辣的味道，不過吃到後面有點膩。\n\n拉麵可以選細麵或粗麵 ，麵跟飯都可以續一份，但是整體吃下來最後有點鹹，個人口味的心得～叉燒是有厚度而且蠻好吃的，兩大塊吃完很飽！\n\n內用座位大概13個左右，座位寬敞，是舒服的空間～餐後結帳。\n\n老闆及服務員態度都很友善且熱情，是一間值得再訪的麵店💕海賊王公仔很多讚👍🏻",null,[0,72]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15170319517674368048/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEZwV1FUSmFha28xV0ROS2VWcDZTbE5XUm1ocldrWm9ZVlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15170319517674368048/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEZwV1FUSmFha28xV0ROS2VWcDZTbE5XUm1ocldrWm9ZVlpWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15170319517674368048/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEZwV1FUSmFha28xV0ROS2VWcDZTbE5XUm1ocldrWm9ZVlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15170319517674368048/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEZwV1FUSmFha28xV0ROS2VWcDZTbE5XUm1ocldrWm9ZVlpWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15170319517674368048/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEZwV1FUSmFha28xV0ROS2VWcDZTbE5XUm1ocldrWm9ZVlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15170319517674368048/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHVEZwV1FUSmFha28xV0ROS2VWcDZTbE5XUm1ocldrWm9ZVlpWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7543,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GTFpWQTJaako1WDNKeVp6SlNWRmhrWkZoYVZVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7d434d74a298a4c9!3m1!1s2@1:CA